musterAllies":null,"musterHaven":null}]}],"trustLines":[{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Helga shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Helga looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Helga shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Helga says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Helga looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Helga says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Helga shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1096 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A man, maybe 40s, with deep-set eyes says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Liam shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Liam says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Liam shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Earl says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Kamshat hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Milo looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1066 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1250 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1290 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Helga counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 7 against.\""},{"day":15,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Helga counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":19,"line":"Earl counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":20,"line":"✨ Ability gained: Loud Chewer (L1). Eating is 2x louder (monsters hear you). But villagers love eating beside you: trust builds 10% faster."},{"day":21,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":22,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Earl counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"3 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":25,"line":"Milo counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 3 against.\""},{"day":26,"line":"At the grave, Marcus speaks for Rosa — \"Helga trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":26,"line":"Earl counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 3 against.\""},{"day":26,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~980 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Earl counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":32,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Kamshat, Marcus speak for Liam — \"Rosa trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":32,"line":"⛓️ Liam brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":33,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,750 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Lena weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":33,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Emberhold's tribute comes up thin — 310 of 4,000 kcal. They sent everything the wagons could carry, and it wasn't enough. The shortfall rides as arrears (+3,690 kcal). (Trust -1.)"},{"day":36,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":38,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1053 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":40,"line":"You refuse Emberhold — gently, honestly, aloud. Lena nods like they expected it. (Trust -5.)"},{"day":41,"line":"Patrick hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":45,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Diplomatic Incident (Level 2). Trust builds 3x (was 2x)."},{"day":46,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1500 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":48,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Emberhold this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +4,000 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":52,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,872 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Lena weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":52,"line":"⛓️ Devon brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":52,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":53,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":53,"line":"⛓️ Pål brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":53,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":53,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":54,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,842 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":56,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,683 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who 