e":"Village meal: +1250 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Priya counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1250 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1282 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Priya counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 7 against.\""},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1150 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"At the grave, Duc, Siobhan speak for Priya — \"Aurora trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":18,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":19,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":19,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Siobhan brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":30,"line":"⛓️ Duc brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":31,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":33,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":33,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,561 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Rosa clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":33,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":37,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":41,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🍖 The feast is warm and good — but your reactor hums its steady note underneath, and the fire never catches. 1.25x, always, is all there is. (Feast buff refused: the reactor is a ceiling as well as a floor.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. 