:"A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 50s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A person, maybe 30s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1114 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A woman, maybe 40s, with a farmer's tan says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 50s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 30s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 30s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A person, maybe 30s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1212 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Gianna hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Regina says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Emer hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1037 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1471 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1009 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Village meal: +1327 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Village meal: +1133 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":20,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":21,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1400 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":22,"line":"Henry saw how close you've gotten to Gianna. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":22,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"Village meal: +1396 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":24,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Tanisha brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":25,"line":"Village meal: +1160 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Tanisha brings it home: Ashford bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1122 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Ashford's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"You give Stonebridge 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Yuki weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"A runner from The Hungry Road II, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":30,"line":"Henry saw how close you've gotten to Gianna. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":30,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":31,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3575 kcal). Trust +5. They'll remember this."},{"day":32,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":32,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":33,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3575 kcal). Trust +5. They'll remember this."},{"day":33,"line":"⛓️ Catalina brings it home: The Hungry Road II bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":33,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":33,"line":"Village meal: +1040 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":34,"line":"They take back the trust your gift earned. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":34,"line":"You took back what you gave. They noticed. Trust -5."},{"day":34,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to The Hungry Road II's fire — a gift, 