e from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":26,"line":"Donated Burdock (+1350 kcal). Trust +2. They'll remember this."},{"day":26,"line":"Donated Burdock (+900 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":26,"line":"Donated Purslane (+1230 kcal). Trust +2. They'll remember this."},{"day":26,"line":"You accept Emberhold's food — 2,725 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Victor clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Mia brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"They take back the trust your gift earned. (Trust -5.)"},{"day":27,"line":"You took back what you gave. They noticed. Trust -5."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Mia brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"Village meal: +1030 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1260 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"Village meal: +1400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Donated Burdock (+2610 kcal). Trust +5. They'll remember this."},{"day":29,"line":"Donated Cattail (+840 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":29,"line":"Donated Purslane (+30 kcal). Trust +0. They'll remember this."},{"day":29,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":29,"line":"Village meal: +1070 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":30,"line":"They