he communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Meera hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Paola says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Juliana looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Jovan shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 30s, with a slouched posture hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Chloe says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Sigrun looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A woman, maybe 30s, with weathered hands says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1443 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 40s, with sun-creased eyes hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 40s, with sun-creased eyes hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":8,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Village meal: +1247 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":10,"line":"◈ FLASHBACK — Notebook\nRoute optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished."},{"day":10,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Village meal: +1087 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Village meal: +1092 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Paola hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Juliana shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Cuauhtémoc hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":16,"line":"Village meal: +1100 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Village meal: +100