ks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a slouched posture says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a slouched posture shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1054 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A woman, maybe 40s, with a limp says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A person, maybe 30s looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A person, maybe 30s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A woman, maybe 40s, with a limp looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 60s, with a slouched posture says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a slouched posture shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Stella: \"It offered me something. A... gift? I said no. I don't trust gifts from the sky.\""},{"day":11,"line":"Ernesto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Ernesto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":11,"line":"Ernesto shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":11,"line":"A runner from Ashford, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Ernesto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":12,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Ernesto says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Ernesto shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Ernesto says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Ernesto says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":13,"line":"Ernesto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Ernesto looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":14,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Stella counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 4 against.\""},{"day":16,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":17,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":17,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":18,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northeast ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":19,"line":"Ernesto saw how close you've gotten to Stella. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":20,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~900 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":21,"line":"Ernesto hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Patricia brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Patricia brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🍖 The feast is warm and good — full bellies, loud laughter — but no keepsake was channeled. The surge must be armed before a feast can carry it: hold a keepsake and channel first. (Feast buff refused: devotion gate.)"},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Patricia brings it home: Ashford bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Ashford's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":30,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":32,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":32,"line":"Ernesto saw how close you've gotten to Stella. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":32,"line":"You accept Emberhold's food — 1,792 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Ben clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":34,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":35,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves ar