s from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":93,"line":"At the grave, Stella, Yakov, Farid and 3 more speak for Pascaline — \"Ernesto trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":98,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":98,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":98,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Ashford turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":98,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":100,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":100,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+540 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":100,"line":"You accept Emberhold's food — 2,502 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Ben clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":100,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,600 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":100,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,573 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":100,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,608 kcal of grain to Ashford's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":101,"line":"Donated Muscadine Grapes (+630 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":103,"line":"At the grave, Yakov, Farid, Fatima and 2 more speak for Stella — \"Pascaline trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":104,"line":"At the grave, Farid, Fatima, Elena and 1 more speak for Yakov — \"Stella trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"INNER VOICE: the others are already afraid. Fear is a kind of respect that doesn't ask for anything back. You could build something here — not on trust. On what people will do to stay on your good side. (Corruption starts at 20. The slope is yours to walk — or not.)"},{"day":105,"line":"At the grave, Farid, Elena, Tashi speak for Fatima — \"Yakov trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"At the grave, Farid, Tashi speak for Elena — \"Fatima trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"At the grave, Farid speaks for Tashi — \"Elena trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Light Fingers (Level 1). Steal from pantry without trust loss (50%). If caught, -20 trust."},{"day":105,"line":"🌾 Nothing comes from Thornfield this week — their fields are as empty as the wagons look. Hunger isn't defiance, but the ledger doesn't know the difference. (Arrears +1,688 kcal, trust -2.)"},{"day":106,"line":"Oluwaseyi hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":106,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1500 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":110,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":110,"line":"💛 Y